1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Listen to a music teacher talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,820
You've all shown interest in playing music

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:10,090
and I know that it's important to all of you.

4
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:14,250
That's why I want you to try out for the Salem Junior Orchestra next month.

5
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:17,520
The orchestra is for middle school students

6
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:20,130
It meets twice a week during the school year.

7
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:23,962
The orchestra has three or four performances a year

8
00:00:23,962 --> 00:00:28,220
and offers a great opportunity for young musicians like you.
